{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21935","headline":"赠元稹 · 白居易","name":"赠元稹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自我从宦游，七年在长安。\n所得惟元君，乃知定交难。\n岂无山上苗，径寸无岁寒。\n岂无要津水，咫尺有波澜。\n之子异於是，久处誓不谖。\n无波古井水，有节秋竹竿。\n一爲同心友，三及芳岁阑。\n花下鞍马游，雪中杯酒欢。\n衡门相逢迎，不具带与冠。\n春风日高睡，秋月夜深看。\n不爲同登科，不爲同署官。\n所合在方寸，心源无异端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}